          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo pandanda ŵandu atyocepe mcilambomo, kuti litaka tilisangalalile yaka yakulipumusya kulilima, ni kuti soni ajiticisye kupocela cilango ligongo lyakugakana malamusi gangu ni kuyinyosya yinalamwile kuti ayitende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atamose yindu yosopeyi yili yitendekwe, ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ali mcilambo ca amagongo ŵawo, une ngasinajasa kapena kuŵengana nawo kwa mpaka kwajonanga. Naga ngutenda myoyo ni kuti cilanga cinapangene nawo jemanjajo mpaka cikasice. Une ndili AMBUJE Mlungu jwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo pakwatendela canasa tinjiŵika soni cilanga cinapangene ni acinangolo ŵawo, ŵinakopwesye mcilambo ca Iguputo ni macili gangu, mitundu ja ŵandu jili mkulola, kuti une AMBUJE mbe Mlungu jwawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
